    v: "Run the benchmark set interpreter-only and with tiers, and a differential correctness suite across tiers. Confirm the speedup justifies the added tier on the target workload and that results are identical at every tier.",
    dep: ["hot-counters", "jit-interface", "type-feedback", "inline-caches", "superinstructions"]
